      <h1>A History of Bitcoin</h1>
      <p class="msc-learn-page__deck">Bitcoin emerged from decades of work on digital cash, cryptography, timestamping, and proof of work. Its history is not a straight line of inevitable progress. It is a record of experiments, setbacks, technical upgrades, public disagreements, and an open network that continued developing without a central owner.</p>
      <ul class="msc-learn-page-meta"><li>Foundations</li><li>Surface</li><li>History</li><li>9 to 10 minutes</li><li>Reviewed 2026-07-15</li></ul>
